  h1: "Bird Species DNA Testing: Which Birds Can Be Tested and How to Choose the Right Test",
  description: "Explore bird species DNA testing for parrots, cockatiels, budgerigars, canaries, finches, pigeons, poultry and waterfowl. Learn about species compatibility, DNA sexing, sample requirements and test selection.",
